17
00:05:57.942 --> 00:06:02.311
<v vader>If this is a consular ship, where is the ambassador?</v>

18
00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:09.363
<v vader>Commander, tear this ship apart until you've found those plans!</v>

19
00:06:09.454 --> 00:06:12.321
<v vader>And bring me the passengers! I want them alivel</v>

20
00:06:25.053 --> 00:06:26.418
