24
00:06:40.151 --> 00:06:41.812
<v c-3po>You'll be deactivated for sure.</v>

25
00:06:43.947 --> 00:06:46.859
<v c-3po>Don't call me a mindless philosopher, you overweight glob of grease.</v>

26
00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:48.531
<v c-3po>Come out, before somebody sees you.</v>

27
00:06:50.662 --> 00:06:52.869
