33
00:07:18.815 --> 00:07:20.806
<v c-3po>Are you sure this thing is safe?</v>

34
00:07:39.752 --> 00:07:42.289
<v leia>Darth Vader. Only you could be so bold.</v>

35
00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:44.621
<v leia>The imperial senate will not sit still for this.</v>

36
00:07:44.716 --> 00:07:46.331
<v leia>When they hear you've attacked...</v>

37
00:07:46.426 --> 00:07:48.166
<v vader>Don't act so surprised, your highness.</v>

38
00:07:48.261 --> 00:07:50.547
<v vader>You weren't on any mercy mission this time.</v>

