<v vader>Several transmissions were beamed to this ship by rebel spies.</v>

40
00:07:54.475 --> 00:07:57.342
<v vader>I want to know what happened to the plans they sent you.</v>

41
00:07:57.562 --> 00:07:59.393
<v leia>I don't know what you're talking about.</v>

42
00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:02.563
<v leia>I'm a member of the imperial senate on a diplomatic mission to alderaan.</v>

43
00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:05.517
<v vader>You are part of the rebel alliance and a traitor.</v>

44
00:08:06.070 --> 00:08:08.026
<v vader>Take her away!</v>

45
00:08:11.784 --> 00:08:13.149
<v role-commander>Holding her is dangerous.</v>

46
00:08:13.244 --> 00:08:14.984
<v role-commander>If word of this gets out, it could generate</v>

47
00:08:15.079 --> 00:08:16.785
<v role-commander>sympathy for the rebellion in the senate.</v>

48
00:08:16.873 --> 00:08:19.535
<v vader>I have traced the rebel spies to her.</v>

49
00:08:19.625 --> 00:08:22.412
<v vader>Now she is my only link to finding their secret base.</v>

50
00:08:22.503 --> 00:08:24.289
<v role-commander>She'll die before she'll tell you anything.</v>

51
00:08:24.380 --> 00:08:25.961
<v vader>I eave that to me.</v>

52
00:08:26.049 --> 00:08:29.541
<v vader>Send a distress signal, and then inform the senate that all aboard were killed.</v>

53
00:08:29.635 --> 00:08:32.843
<v praji>Lord vader, the battle station plans are not aboard this ship</v>

