<v vader>She must have hidden the plans in the escape pod.</v>

58
00:08:41.856 --> 00:08:43.721
<v vader>Send a detachment down to retrieve them.</v>

59
00:08:43.816 --> 00:08:45.477
<v vader>See to it personally, commander.</v>

60
00:08:45.568 --> 00:08:47.479
<v vader>There'll be no one to stop us this time.</v>

61
