<v c-3po>Where do you think you're going?</v>

68
00:09:33.866 --> 00:09:35.356
<v c-3po>Well, I'm not going that way.</v>

69
00:09:36.119 --> 00:09:38.075
<v c-3po>It's much too rocky.</v>

70
00:09:38.162 --> 00:09:40.073
<v c-3po>This way is much easier.</v>

71
00:09:40.164 --> 00:09:42.621
<v c-3po>What makes you think there are settlements over there?</v>

72
