00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:49.462
<v c-3po>What mission? What are you talking about?</v>

74
00:09:51.676 --> 00:09:54.543
<v c-3po>I've just about had enough of you.</v>

75
00:09:54.637 --> 00:09:55.877
<v c-3po>Go that way.</v>

76
00:09:55.972 --> 00:09:59.681
<v c-3po>You'll be malfunctioning within a day, you nearsighted scrap pile.</v>

77
00:09:59.767 --> 00:10:02.224
<v c-3po>And don't let me catch you following me, begging for help</v>

78
00:10:02.311 --> 00:10:03.676
<v c-3po>because you won't get it.</v>

79
00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:19.150
<v c-3po>No more adventures.</v>

80
00:10:19.245 --> 00:10:21.327
<v c-3po>I'm not going that way.</v>

81
00:10:55.364 --> 00:10:58.356
<v c-3po>That malfunctioning little twerp. This is all his fault.</v>

82
00:10:59.368 --> 00:11:01.450
<v c-3po>He tricked me into going this way,</v>

