89
00:14:55.688 --> 00:14:59.522
R2-d2, it is you! It is you!

90
00:15:33.017 --> 00:15:36.976
<v role-stormtrooper>Someone was in the pod. The tracks go off in this direction.</v>

91
00:15:37.062 --> 00:15:38.973
<v role-stormtrooper>Look, sir. Droids.</v>

92
00:15:53.746 --> 00:15:54.986
We stopped.

93
00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:56.820
<v c-3po>Wake up. Wake up!</v>

94
