<v c-3po>Do you think they'll melt us down?</v>

96
00:16:28.531 --> 00:16:30.692
<v c-3po>Don't shoot. Don't shoot.</v>

97
00:16:30.783 --> 00:16:32.944
<v c-3po>Will this never end?</v>

98
00:17:12.324 --> 00:17:15.111
Fine. Let's go.
