116
00:18:14.178 --> 00:18:15.338
<v owen>Luke!</v>

117
00:18:17.097 --> 00:18:18.883
<v owen>Take these two over to the garage, will you?</v>

118
00:18:18.974 --> 00:18:20.510
<v owen>I want them cleaned up before dinner.</v>

119
00:18:20.601 --> 00:18:23.343
<v luke>But I was going into tosche station to pick up some power converters.</v>

120
00:18:23.437 --> 00:18:26.019
