<v luke>(Chuckles) Just Luke.</v>

154
00:20:27.603 --> 00:20:30.766
<v c-3po>And I am c-3po, human-cyborg relations.</v>

155
00:20:30.856 --> 00:20:33.518
<v c-3po>And this is my counterpart, r2-d2.</v>

156
00:20:33.609 --> 00:20:34.894
<v luke>Hello.</v>

157
00:20:36.236 --> 00:20:37.897
<v luke>You got a lot of carbon scoring here.</v>

