01:26:48.246 --> 01:26:50.157
You seen that new v1-167

1006
01:26:50.248 --> 01:26:52.534
yeah. Some of the other guys were telling me about it.

1007
01:26:52.625 --> 01:26:54.616
They say it's quite a thing to see. (Thump)

1008
01:26:54.711 --> 01:26:56.918
<v role-stormtrooper>What was that?</v>

1009
01:26:57.005 --> 01:27:00.247
<v role-stormtrooper>It's nothing. Outgassing. Don't worry about it.</v>

1010
01:27:05.263 --> 01:27:07.219
<v han>There she is.</v>
<v luke>C-3p0, do you copy?</v>

1011
01:27:07.474 --> 01:27:08.474
<v c-3po>Yes, sir.</v>

1012
01:27:08.558 --> 01:27:10.423
Are you safe?
<v c-3po>For the moment</v>

1013
01:27:10.935 --> 01:27:12.846
<v c-3po>we're in the main hangar across from the ship.</v>

1014
01:27:15.190 --> 01:27:16.896
<v luke>We're right above you. Stand by.</v>

1015
01:27:16.983 --> 01:27:19.565
<v leia>You came in that thing? You're braver than I thought.</v>

1016
01:27:19.652 --> 01:27:21.643
<v han>Nice. Come on.</v>

1017
01:27:25.325 --> 01:27:26.735
<v role-stormtrooper>It's them. Blast them.</v>

1018
01:27:28.203 --> 01:27:29.488
<v han>Get back to the ship!</v>
Aargh!

1019
01:27:29.579 --> 01:27:31.849
<v luke>Where are you going? Leia: He certainly has courage.</v>

1020
01:27:31.873 --> 01:27:34.990
<v luke>What good will it do us if he gets himself killed? Come on.</v>

1021
01:27:40.882 --> 01:27:42.247
Aaaah!

1022
01:28:00.485 --> 01:28:02.476
<v luke>I think we took a wrong turn.</v>

1023
01:28:07.450 --> 01:28:08.450
<v leia>There's no lock.</v>

1024
01:28:12.497 --> 01:28:15.364
<v luke>That oughta hold them for a while.</v>
<v leia>Quick. We've got to get across.</v>

1025
01:28:15.458 --> 01:28:18.791
<v leia>Find the controls to extend the bridge.</v>
<v luke>I think I just blasted it.</v>

1026
01:28:18.878 --> 01:28:20.493
<v leia>They're coming through.</v>

1027
01:28:42.861 --> 01:28:44.522
<v luke>Here, hold this.</v>

1028
01:29:01.254 --> 01:29:02.460
<v leia>Here they come.</v>

1029
01:29:13.308 --> 01:29:14.844
<v leia>For luck.</v>

1030
01:29:20.982 --> 01:29:25.692
We think they may be splitting up. They may be on level 5 and 6 now, sir.

1031
01:29:39.792 --> 01:29:41.828
<v c-3po>Where could they be?</v>

1032
01:29:45.924 --> 01:29:47.460
<v role-stormtrooper>Close the blast doors.</v>

1033
01:29:54.641 --> 01:29:56.882
<v role-stormtrooper>Open the blast doors. Open the blast doors.</v>

1034
01:30:15.411 --> 01:30:20.872
<v vader>I've been waiting for you, Obi-Wan. We meet again at last.</v>

1035
01:30:20.959 --> 01:30:22.665
<v vader>The circle is now complete.</v>

1036
01:30:23.044 --> 01:30:24.955
<v vader>When I left you, I was but the learner.</v>

1037
01:30:25.046 --> 01:30:27.412
<v vader>Now I am the master.</v>

1038
01:30:27.507 --> 01:30:29.839
<v obi-wan>Only a master of evil, darth.</v>

1039
01:30:49.821 --> 01:30:52.107
<v vader>Your powers are weak, old man.</v>

1040
01:30:52.782 --> 01:30:55.945
<v obi-wan>You can't win, darth. If you strike me down,</v>

1041
01:30:56.035 --> 01:30:59.448
<v obi-wan>I shall become more powerful than you can possibly imagine.</v>

1042
01:31:06.796 --> 01:31:08.832
<v vader>You should not have come back.</v>

1043
01:31:34.574 --> 01:31:36.189
<v han>Didn't we just leave this party?</v>

1044
01:31:36.367 --> 01:31:37.447
Aargh!

1045
01:31:38.953 --> 01:31:41.444
<v leia>What kept you? We ran into some old friends.</v>

1046
01:31:41.539 --> 01:31:43.825
<v luke>The ship all right?</v>
<v han>Seems okay, if we can get to it.</v>

1047
01:31:43.958 --> 01:31:45.914
<v han>I hope the old man got the tractor beam down.</v>

1048
01:32:01.267 --> 01:32:02.507
<v leia>Look.</v>

1049
01:32:05.438 --> 01:32:07.394
<v c-3po>Come on, r2. We're going.</v>

1050
01:32:09.067 --> 01:32:10.182
<v han>Now's our chance. Gol</v>

1051
01:32:14.072 --> 01:32:15.312
<v luke>Ben?</v>

1052
01:32:30.505 --> 01:32:31.505
Nol

1053
01:32:40.306 --> 01:32:41.466
Come on!
<v han>Luke, come on!</v>

1054
01:32:42.433 --> 01:32:44.014
<v han>Come on!</v>

1055
01:32:44.102 --> 01:32:47.219
<v leia>Luke, it's too late!</v>
<v han>Blast the door, kid!</v>

1056
01:32:56.864 --> 01:32:58.400
<v obi-wan>Run, Luke, run.</v>

1057
01:33:01.577 --> 01:33:03.989
<v han>I hope that old man got the tractor beam out of commission,</v>

1058
01:33:04.080 --> 01:33:06.196
<v han>or this is gonna be a short trip. Okay, hit it!</v>

1059
01:33:17.635 --> 01:33:19.296
Aargh aargh!

1060
01:33:38.364 --> 01:33:40.275
<v han>We're coming up on their sentry ships.</v>

1061
01:33:40.366 --> 01:33:42.152
<v han>Hold them oft. Angle the deflector shields</v>

1062
01:33:42.243 --> 01:33:43.858
<v han>while I charge up the main guns.</v>

1063
01:33:52.962 --> 01:33:54.953
<v luke>I can't believe he's gone.</v>

1064
01:33:58.885 --> 01:34:00.671
<v leia>There wasn't anything you could have done.</v>

1065
01:34:01.387 --> 01:34:03.343
<v han>Come on, buddy. We're not out of this yet.</v>

1066
01:34:20.198 --> 01:34:22.564
<v han>You in, kid? Okay, stay sharp.</v>

1067
01:34:33.419 --> 01:34:34.534
<v leia>Here they come.</v>

1068
01:34:52.563 --> 01:34:54.394
<v luke>They're coming in too fast!</v>

1069
01:35:02.406 --> 01:35:06.240
<v leia>We've lost the lateral controls.</v>
<v han>Don't worry. She'll hold together.</v>

1070
01:35:07.912 --> 01:35:09.823
<v han>Hear me, baby? Hold together.</v>

1071
01:35:26.555 --> 01:35:27.886
Ha hal!

1072
01:35:31.894 --> 01:35:33.475
<v luke>Got him. I got him!</v>

1073
01:35:33.771 --> 01:35:35.932
<v han>Great, kid. Don't get cocky.</v>

1074
01:35:37.149 --> 01:35:38.935
<v leia>There's still two more of them out there.</v>

1075
01:36:12.810 --> 01:36:15.643
That's it. We did it. We did it.

1076
01:36:16.605 --> 01:36:19.142
<v c-3po>Help. I think I'm melting. This is all your fault.</v>

1077
01:36:27.158 --> 01:36:28.568
<v tarkin>Are they away?</v>

1078
01:36:28.659 --> 01:36:31.617
<v vader>They've just made the jump into hyperspace.</v>

1079
01:36:31.704 --> 01:36:35.117
<v tarkin>You're sure the homing beacon is secure aboard their ship?</v>

1080
01:36:36.334 --> 01:36:38.871
<v tarkin>I'm taking an awful risk, vader.</v>

1081
01:36:38.961 --> 01:36:40.622
<v tarkin>This had better work.</v>

1082
01:36:41.422 --> 01:36:43.663
<v han>Not a bad bit of rescuing, huh?</v>

1083
01:36:43.758 --> 01:36:46.795
<v han>You know, sometimes I amaze even myself.</v>

1084
01:36:47.136 --> 01:36:49.252
<v leia>That doesn't sound too hard.</v>

1085
01:36:49.347 --> 01:36:53.340
<v leia>They let us go. It's the only explanation for the ease of our escape.</v>

1086
01:36:53.434 --> 01:36:56.221
<v han>Easy? You call that easy?</v>
<v leia>They're tracking us.</v>

1087
01:36:56.312 --> 01:36:57.722
<v han>Not this ship, sister.</v>

1088
01:36:59.023 --> 01:37:01.560
<v leia>At least the information in r2 is still intact.</v>

1089
01:37:01.817 --> 01:37:04.058
<v han>What's so important? What's he carrying?</v>

1090
01:37:04.195 --> 01:37:07.312
<v leia>The technical readouts of that battle station.</v>

1091
01:37:07.406 --> 01:37:10.694
<v leia>I only hope that when the data's analyzed a weakness can be found.</v>

1092
01:37:10.785 --> 01:37:14.152
<v leia>It's not over yet.</v>
<v han>It is for me, sister.</v>

1093
01:37:14.246 --> 01:37:15.952
<v han>Look, I ain't in this for your revolution,</v>

1094
01:37:16.040 --> 01:37:17.746
<v han>and I'm not in it for you, Princess.</v>

1095
01:37:17.833 --> 01:37:20.575
<v han>I expect to be well paid. I'm in it for the money.</v>

1096
01:37:20.836 --> 01:37:22.872
<v leia>You needn't worry about your reward.</v>

1097
01:37:22.963 --> 01:37:25.875
<v leia>If money is all that you love, then that's what you'll receive.</v>

1098
01:37:29.053 --> 01:37:30.964
<v leia>Your friend is quite a mercenary.</v>

1099
01:37:31.055 --> 01:37:34.297
<v leia>I wonder if he really cares about anything or anybody.</v>

1100
01:37:35.559 --> 01:37:37.049
<v luke>I care.</v>

1101
01:37:45.694 --> 01:37:47.434
<v luke>What do you think of her, han?</v>

1102
01:37:47.530 --> 01:37:49.111
<v han>I'm trying not to, kid.</v>

1103
01:37:50.241 --> 01:37:51.241
<v luke>Good.</v>

1104
01:37:55.162 --> 01:37:57.494
<v han>Still, she's got a lot of spirit.</v>

1105
01:38:00.167 --> 01:38:02.749
<v han>What do you think? You think a Princess and a guy like me...</v>

1106
01:38:02.837 --> 01:38:03.837
<v luke>No.</v>

1107
01:38:51.260 --> 01:38:54.297
<v willard>You're safe. When we heard about alderaan, we feared the worst.</v>

1108
01:38:54.388 --> 01:38:56.299
<v leia>We have no time for sorrows, commander.</v>

1109
01:38:56.390 --> 01:38:59.382
<v leia>You must use the information in this r2 unit to help plan the attack.</v>

1110
01:38:59.477 --> 01:39:01.468
<v leia>It's our only hope.</v>

1111
01:39:22.583 --> 01:39:23.583
<v tarkin>Yes.</v>

1112
01:39:23.667 --> 01:39:25.282
<v role-man>We're approaching the planet yavin.</v>

1113
01:39:25.377 --> 01:39:27.709
The rebel base is on a moon on the far side.

1114
01:39:27.796 --> 01:39:29.787
We are preparing to orbit the planet.

1115
01:39:38.807 --> 01:39:40.889
<v dodonna>The battle station is heavily shielded</v>

1116
01:39:40.976 --> 01:39:44.434
<v dodonna>and carries a firepower greater than half the starfleet.</v>

1117
01:39:45.147 --> 01:39:49.231
<v dodonna>Its defenses are designed around a direct large-scale assault.</v>

1118
01:39:49.860 --> 01:39:54.524
<v dodonna>A small, one-man fighter should be able to penetrate the outer defense.</v>

1119
01:39:56.325 --> 01:39:57.405
<v role-pilot>Pardon me for asking, sir,</v>

1120
01:39:57.493 --> 01:40:00.109
<v role-pilot>but what good are snub fighters against that?</v>

1121
01:40:00.204 --> 01:40:04.789
<v dodonna>The empire doesn't consider a small, one-man fighter to be any threat</v>

1122
01:40:04.875 --> 01:40:07.537
<v dodonna>or they'd have a tighter defense.</v>

1123
01:40:07.711 --> 01:40:10.999
<v dodonna>An analysis of the plans provided by Princess Leia</v>

1124
01:40:11.090 --> 01:40:14.173
<v dodonna>has demonstrated a weakness in the battle station.</v>

1125
01:40:15.010 --> 01:40:17.001
<v dodonna>The approach will not be easy.</v>

1126
01:40:17.638 --> 01:40:20.220
<v dodonna>You're required to maneuver straight down this trench</v>

1127
01:40:20.307 --> 01:40:22.923
<v dodonna>and skim the surface to this point.</v>

1128
01:40:23.769 --> 01:40:26.511
<v dodonna>The target area is only two meters wide.</v>

1129
01:40:26.689 --> 01:40:30.273
<v dodonna>It's a small thermal exhaust port right below the main port.</v>

1130
01:40:31.819 --> 01:40:34.686
<v dodonna>The shaft leads directly to the reactor system.</v>

1131
01:40:34.780 --> 01:40:37.522
<v dodonna>A precise hit will start a chain reaction</v>

1132
01:40:37.616 --> 01:40:39.823
<v dodonna>which should destroy the station.</v>

1133
01:40:39.910 --> 01:40:43.448
<v dodonna>Only a precise hit will set up a chain reaction.</v>

1134
01:40:43.539 --> 01:40:46.702
<v dodonna>The shaft is ray-shielded, so you'll have to use proton torpedoes.</v>

1135
01:40:47.209 --> 01:40:48.949
<v wedge>That's impossible, even for a computer.</v>

1136
01:40:49.044 --> 01:40:50.250
<v luke>But it's not impossible.</v>

1137
01:40:50.337 --> 01:40:52.828
<v luke>I used to bull's-eye womp rats in my t-16 back home.</v>

1138
01:40:52.923 --> 01:40:55.335
<v luke>They're not much bigger than two meters.</v>

1139
01:40:55.426 --> 01:40:58.589
<v dodonna>Then man your ships, and may the force be with you.</v>

1140
01:41:06.854 --> 01:41:09.436
<v role-man>Orbiting the planet at maximum velocity,</v>

1141
01:41:10.107 --> 01:41:13.816
the moon with the rebel base will be in range in 30 minutes.

1142
01:41:14.069 --> 01:41:16.526
<v vader>This will be a day long remembered.</v>

1143
01:41:16.614 --> 01:41:18.605
<v vader>It has seen the end of Kenobi</v>

1144
01:41:18.699 --> 01:41:21.736
<v vader>and will soon see the end of the rebellion.</v>

1145
01:41:27.041 --> 01:41:30.283
<v role-man>All flight crews, man your stations.</v>

1146
01:41:30.669 --> 01:41:33.160
<v role-voice>All flight crews, man your stations.</v>

1147
01:41:35.758 --> 01:41:38.875
<v luke>So, you got your reward and you're just leaving, then?</v>

1148
01:41:38.969 --> 01:41:40.960
<v han>That's right. Yeah.</v>

1149
01:41:42.056 --> 01:41:44.672
<v han>I got some old debts I gotta pay off with this stuff.</v>

1150
01:41:44.767 --> 01:41:46.928
<v han>Even if I didn't, you don't think I'd be fool enough</v>

1151
01:41:47.019 --> 01:41:49.226
<v han>to stick around here, do ya?</v>

1152
01:41:49.313 --> 01:41:50.644
<v han>Why don't you come with us?</v>

1153
01:41:50.731 --> 01:41:52.687
<v han>You're pretty good in a fight. We could use ya.</v>

1154
01:41:52.775 --> 01:41:55.642
<v luke>Come on. Why don't you take a look around?</v>

1155
01:41:55.736 --> 01:41:58.398
<v luke>You know what's about to happen, what they're up against.</v>

1156
01:41:58.489 --> 01:42:01.606
<v luke>They could use a good pilot like you. You're turning your back on them.</v>

1157
01:42:01.909 --> 01:42:04.070
<v han>What good's a reward if you ain't around to use it?</v>

1158
01:42:04.286 --> 01:42:07.119
<v han>Besides, attacking that battle station ain't my idea of courage.</v>

1159
01:42:07.206 --> 01:42:09.788
<v han>It's more like suicide.</v>

1160
01:42:11.627 --> 01:42:14.460
<v luke>All right. Well, take care of yourself, han.</v>

1161
01:42:14.546 --> 01:42:17.208
<v luke>I guess that's what you're best at, isn't it?</v>

1162
01:42:17.591 --> 01:42:18.626
<v han>Hey, Luke.</v>

1163
01:42:21.970 --> 01:42:24.336
<v han>May the force be with you.</v>

1164
01:42:27.601 --> 01:42:28.807
Argh!

1165
01:42:30.854 --> 01:42:34.472
<v han>What are you looking at? I know what I'm doing.</v>

1166
01:42:38.570 --> 01:42:40.936
<v role-man>All pilots to your stations.</v>

1167
01:42:42.116 --> 01:42:44.072
All pilots to your stations.

1168
01:42:49.581 --> 01:42:52.118
<v leia>What's wrong?</v>
<v luke>Oh, it's han.</v>

1169
01:42:52.209 --> 01:42:54.700
<v luke>I don't know. I really thought he'd change his mind.</v>

1170
01:42:54.795 --> 01:42:58.333
<v leia>He's got to follow his own path. No one can choose it for him.</v>

1171
01:42:59.341 --> 01:43:02.128
<v luke>I only wish Ben were here.</v>

1172
01:43:09.810 --> 01:43:12.722
<v role-man>Open main launch tubes.</v>

1173
01:43:12.813 --> 01:43:14.724
<v role-man>Main launch tubes opening, sir.</v>

1174
01:43:14.815 --> 01:43:16.476
Hey, Luke!

1175
01:43:16.567 --> 01:43:19.775
Biggs!
<v biggs>I don't believe it. How are ya?</v>

1176
01:43:19.862 --> 01:43:21.944
Coming up?
<v luke>I'll be up there with you.</v>

1177
01:43:22.030 --> 01:43:24.567
<v luke>Have I got stories to tell you.</v>
Skywalker.

1178
01:43:25.993 --> 01:43:27.608
Are you sure you can handle this ship?

1179
01:43:27.703 --> 01:43:31.537
<v biggs>Sir, Luke is the best bush pilot in the outer-rim territories.</v>

1180
01:43:32.166 --> 01:43:34.657
<v role-pilot>You'll do all right.</v>
<v luke>Thank you, sir. I'll try.</v>

1181
01:43:34.752 --> 01:43:38.665
<v biggs>Gotta get aboard. We'll hear all your stories when we get back, all right?</v>

1182
01:43:38.756 --> 01:43:41.498
<v luke>Hey, Biggs. I told you I'd make it someday.</v>

1183
01:43:41.592 --> 01:43:44.584
<v biggs>It'll be like old times, Luke. They'll never stop us.</v>

1184
01:43:45.095 --> 01:43:46.095
<v role-man>Stand clear:</v>

1185
01:43:47.473 --> 01:43:50.385
<v role-commander>This r2 unit of yours seems a bit beat up. You want a new one?</v>

1186
01:43:50.768 --> 01:43:53.635
<v luke>Not on your life. That little droid and I have been through a lot.</v>

1187
01:43:53.729 --> 01:43:54.764
<v luke>You okay, r27</v>

1188
01:43:56.398 --> 01:43:57.808
Good.

1189
01:43:58.859 --> 01:44:02.192
<v role-man>Gold squadron, begin takeoff procedure.</v>

1190
01:44:02.279 --> 01:44:05.271
<v c-3po>Hang on tight, r2. You've got to come back.</v>

1191
01:44:06.950 --> 01:44:09.157
<v c-3po>You wouldn't want my life to get boring, would you?</v>

1192
01:44:57.960 --> 01:45:00.952
<v obi-wan>Luke, the force will be with you.</v>

1193
01:45:12.766 --> 01:45:16.054
<v role-man>Standby alert. Death star approaching.</v>

1194
01:45:16.144 --> 01:45:19.307
<v role-voice>Estimated time to firing range, 15 minutes.</v>

1195
01:45:32.411 --> 01:45:34.652
<v role-pilot>All wings report in.</v>
<v role-pilot>Red 10 standing by.</v>

1196
01:45:34.746 --> 01:45:36.987
<v role-man>Red seven standing by.</v>
<v biggs>Red three standing by.</v>

1197
01:45:37.082 --> 01:45:39.824
<v porkins>Red six standing by.</v>
<v role-man>Red nine standing by.</v>

1198
01:45:39.918 --> 01:45:41.954
<v wedge>Red two standing by.</v>
<v role-man>Red 11 standing by.</v>

1199
01:45:42.045 --> 01:45:44.001
<v luke>Red five standing by.</v>

1200
01:45:45.340 --> 01:45:47.251
<v role-pilot>Lock s-foils in attack position.</v>

1201
01:45:51.513 --> 01:45:53.504
<v role-man>We're passing through the magnetic field.</v>

1202
01:45:53.599 --> 01:45:56.386
<v role-pilot>Hold tight. Switch your deflectors on.</v>

1203
01:45:56.476 --> 01:45:57.932
<v role-pilot>Double front</v>

1204
01:46:00.939 --> 01:46:02.429
<v wedge>look at the size of that thing.</v>

1205
01:46:02.524 --> 01:46:05.357
<v role-pilot>Cut the chatter, red two. Accelerate to attack speed.</v>

1206
01:46:08.822 --> 01:46:11.564
<v role-pilot>This is it, boys.</v>
<v role-pilot>Red leader, this is gold leader.</v>

